cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "nullius: gates that refuse an unbacked research claim"
message: "If you use these gates or the read-depth register, please cite."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Noonan
    given-names: Adam
repository-code: "https://github.com/ACNoonan/nullius"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - research integrity
  - AI-assisted research
  - provenance
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Blocking checks that refuse an AI-assisted research claim until an artifact
  on disk backs it. Five write-time gates plus build-time provenance and
  prose-leak checks, with a read-depth register (full, targeted,
  fetch-summary, snippet, unsearched) for declaring how deeply each source was
  actually read.
